<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>{{ $title }} · AutoCare</title><style>:root{--lime:#c9ff57;--ink:#080b10;--muted:#93a0b5;--line:#263143}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--ink);color:#f7f8fa;font:14px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif}.auth{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;min-height:100vh}.intro{padding:46px 8vw;background:radial-gradient(circle at 65% 38%,#1e3354 0,transparent 24%),linear-gradient(135deg,#111c30,#080b10);position:relative;overflow:hidden}.intro:after{content:'AUT O CARE';position:absolute;left:-2vw;bottom:-5vw;font:900 12vw/1 Arial;color:#ffffff08;white-space:nowrap}.kicker{color:var(--lime);font:700 11px Arial;letter-spacing:.15em}.logo{font-size:21px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.8px}.logo span{color:var(--lime)}.intro h1{max-width:650px;font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,84px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:17vh 0 23px}.intro p{color:#bbc7d9;max-width:475px;font-size:16px}.system{position:absolute;bottom:45px;color:#8493aa;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em}.form-side{display:grid;place-items:center;padding:32px;background:#0d131d}.form-box{width:min(100%,400px)}h2{font-size:33px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:0 0 7px}.sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 28px}label{display:block;margin:18px 0 7px;font-weight:bold;font-size:12px;color:#cad4e2}input{width:100%;background:#111b29;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;color:#fff;padding:13px;outline:none}input:focus{border-color:var(--lime);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #c9ff5717}.button{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:7px;background:var(--lime);color:#10170b;padding:13px;margin-top:25px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.link{color:var(--lime);text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}.switch{color:var(--muted);margin-top:23px;text-align:center}.notice{padding:11px 13px;border-radius:7px;background:#d6ff9d;color:#172206;margin-bottom:16px}.errors{background:#35191f;color:#ffbbc4;padding:10px 13px;border-radius:7px;margin-bottom:15px}@media(max-width:750px){.auth{grid-template-columns:1fr}.intro{min-height:260px;padding:30px}.intro h1{margin:55px 0 10px;font-size:44px}.system{bottom:25px}.form-side{padding:42px 25px}}</style></head><body><main class="auth"><section class="intro"><div class="logo">AUTO<span>CARE</span> / SIS.INFO</div><div class="kicker">STATUS: SYSTEM ONLINE</div><h1>Informasi yang membuat perawatan lebih pasti.</h1><p>Kelola kendaraan, riwayat servis, jadwal, dan laporan dalam satu sistem yang terstruktur.</p><div class="system">AUT O CARE · VEHICLE INFORMATION SYSTEM · EST.2026</div></section><section class="form-side"><div class="form-box">{{ $slot }}</div></section></main></body></html>
